{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cartorio-api-v1-2026-07-15",
    "name": "Cartorio API v1",
    "description": "Collection Postman para a API REST do 2o Servico Notarial de Uberlandia.\n\nCobre 73 endpoints catalogados em `.brain/api-specs/catalog.py` (v1 + v2 + OpenClaw gateway).\n\n## Canais\n\n- Health radar + radar/expanded\n- Telegram bot (CartorioBot)\n- WhatsApp (Evolution API)\n- LGPD direitos do titular (Art. 18) + v2 (JWT DPO) + RIPD + Privacy Policy\n- Audit log (integridade SHA256 chain + HMAC)\n- Brain (BRAIN2 tasks, lessons, sync)\n- OpenClaw gateway (REST OpenAI-compat + WS v4 + Admin RPC)\n\n## Autenticacao\n\n- Endpoints publicos: Health, Emolumento, Telegram webhook (HMAC), WhatsApp webhook.\n- X-API-Key: header `X-API-Key: <key>` para admin + integrations.\n- JWT DPO: header `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>` para endpoints LGPD v2.\n\n## Variaveis de environment (Cartorio_Env.production)\n\n- `base_url` — default `https://api.2notasudi.com.br`\n- `telegram_bot_token` — placeholder (NUNCA commitar valor real)\n- `x_api_key_dpo` — placeholder (NUNCA commitar valor real)\n- `x_api_key_n8n` — placeholder (NUNCA commitar valor real)\n\nGenerated by squad cartorio-front / Missao F6 [P2] / 2026-07-15.\nModified by Gustavo Almeida.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://api.2notasudi.com.br",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "telegram_bot_token",
      "value": "REPLACE_WITH_BOTFATHER_TOKEN",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "x_api_key_dpo",
      "value": "REPLACE_WITH_DPO_KEY",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "x_api_key_n8n",
      "value": "REPLACE_WITH_N8N_KEY",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
